          <crm:E33_Linguistic_Object rdf:about="http://www.lynx.com/resource/person/1000/timeline/babe2ba4cbdd/source-text">
            <rdfs:label>This interest also drove his research at Hadrian's Villa and the Baiae excavations, where he served as scientific director for underwater research.</rdfs:label>
