            <rdfs:label>Between 1960 and 1970, he published studies on painting and sculpture, including the Esquiline fresco cycle (1962), the Aldobrandini Wedding (1962), and imitation vs. originality in 3rd-century AD sarcophagi (1970).</rdfs:label>
            <crm:P2_has_type rdf:resource="http://www.lynx.com/resource/source-text"/>
          </crm:E33_Linguistic_Object>
